WEBVTT

1
00:00:29.958 --> 00:00:33.583
In this verse, Lord Krishna describes a true yogi...

2
00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:34.625
He says

3
00:00:34.625 --> 00:00:38.416
that one who focuses their mind on the Divine...

4
00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:39.583
experiences supreme bliss

5
00:00:39.583 --> 00:00:43.666
beyond material pleasures within themselves...

6
00:00:43.666 --> 00:00:46.166
And through this spiritual realization,

7
00:00:46.166 --> 00:00:49.458
they attain eternal happiness...

8
00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:55.875
How does a person attain lasting happiness

9
00:00:55.875 --> 00:00:59.875
and supreme bliss...?

10
00:00:59.875 --> 00:01:04.916
Lord Krishna answers this question 
very simply in this verse,

11
00:01:04.916 --> 00:01:06.166
saying...

12
00:01:06.166 --> 00:01:09.875
One who abandons worldly attachments

13
00:01:09.875 --> 00:01:12.500
and centers their attention on the Divine...

14
00:01:12.500 --> 00:01:15.625
Such a person isn't disturbed by 
material illusions

15
00:01:15.625 --> 00:01:18.500
and circumstances...

16
00:01:18.500 --> 00:01:23.625
Nor does their happiness depend 
on these material conditions...

17
00:01:23.625 --> 00:01:26.083
After gaining spiritual knowledge,

18
00:01:26.083 --> 00:01:28.916
a person becomes familiar with the truth

19
00:01:28.916 --> 00:01:32.458
that neither material possessions,
nor physical pleasures,

20
00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:35.250
nor praise from others...

21
00:01:35.250 --> 00:01:38.791
will provide that supreme bliss throughout life...

22
00:01:38.791 --> 00:01:41.625
what Lord Krishna calls eternal happiness...

23
00:01:41.625 --> 00:01:45.041
Such joy that will always remain within them...

24
00:01:45.041 --> 00:01:46.041
When a person becomes familiar

25
00:01:46.041 --> 00:01:48.916
with this truth of life that...

26
00:01:48.916 --> 00:01:51.083
material wealth, success,

27
00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:53.541
or physical pleasures are temporary...

28
00:01:53.541 --> 00:01:57.916
Just as flowing water in a river never stays still...

29
00:01:57.916 --> 00:02:00.916
Similarly, the cycle of attachment
 to material pleasures

30
00:02:00.916 --> 00:02:03.208
continues endlessly...

31
00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:06.916
After attaining one pleasure, the
 desire for new pleasures

32
00:02:06.916 --> 00:02:09.791
keeps arising in the mind...

33
00:02:09.791 --> 00:02:14.416
and this becomes the cause of
 restlessness and discontent...

34
00:02:14.416 --> 00:02:17.708
Lord Krishna says that... Real 
happiness isn't in material

35
00:02:17.708 --> 00:02:20.833
objects and wealth,

36
00:02:20.833 --> 00:02:22.500
but within the person...

37
00:02:22.500 --> 00:02:24.333
When one frees their intellect and mind

38
00:02:24.333 --> 00:02:26.208
from the web of material world attachments

39
00:02:26.208 --> 00:02:29.458
and focuses on the Divine...

40
00:02:29.458 --> 00:02:30.916
then they attain true joy

41
00:02:30.916 --> 00:02:33.291
and contentment...

42
00:02:33.291 --> 00:02:36.291
This inner happiness born from
 spiritual connection

43
00:02:36.291 --> 00:02:41.750
is the real success of human life...

44
00:02:46.291 --> 00:02:48.416
I know,

45
00:02:48.416 --> 00:02:51.208
in current circumstances,

46
00:02:51.208 --> 00:02:55.375
you're wandering in search of material pleasures...

47
00:02:55.375 --> 00:02:58.291
Whether it's success in business...

48
00:02:58.291 --> 00:03:03.208
or praise and fame on social media...

49
00:03:03.208 --> 00:03:06.291
But do you know,

50
00:03:06.291 --> 00:03:10.083
the joy you're seeking...

51
00:03:10.083 --> 00:03:13.750
won't stay with you forever...!!!

52
00:03:13.750 --> 00:03:16.750
When you tie your happiness to
 this material world...

53
00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:21.041
be it wealth, praise,

54
00:03:21.041 --> 00:03:25.541
or physical pleasure...

55
00:03:25.541 --> 00:03:31.250
then these very material pleasures become
 the cause of your discontent and unrest...

56
00:03:31.250 --> 00:03:32.833
Remember,

57
00:03:32.833 --> 00:03:36.500
you attain supreme bliss

58
00:03:36.500 --> 00:03:39.791
when you free your intellect and mind

59
00:03:39.791 --> 00:03:44.125
from this material world's entanglements

60
00:03:44.125 --> 00:03:46.666
and connect with the Divine...

61
00:03:46.666 --> 00:03:48.291
Then you attain true joy

62
00:03:48.291 --> 00:03:51.500
and happiness...

63
00:03:51.500 --> 00:03:54.125
This is eternal happiness...

64
00:03:54.125 --> 00:03:57.833
Become like that craftsman...

65
00:03:57.833 --> 00:04:01.500
who completes his craft with full faith,

66
00:04:01.500 --> 00:04:05.666
concentration, and dedication...

67
00:04:05.666 --> 00:04:08.458
That craftsman's joy and satisfaction

68
00:04:08.458 --> 00:04:11.833
lie in his work... not in any

69
00:04:11.833 --> 00:04:15.833
material praise or reward...

70
00:04:15.833 --> 00:04:17.833
Remember,

71
00:04:17.833 --> 00:04:20.041
your search for happiness and peace

72
00:04:20.041 --> 00:04:23.708
in material objects is futile...

73
00:04:23.708 --> 00:04:25.833
This temporary pleasure and joy

74
00:04:25.833 --> 00:04:29.291
is an endless cycle...

75
00:04:29.291 --> 00:04:33.708
which will only give you pain
 and dissatisfaction...

76
00:04:33.708 --> 00:04:38.125
Therefore, free yourself from
 material world attachments

77
00:04:38.125 --> 00:04:42.125
and establish a connection with the Divine...

78
00:04:42.125 --> 00:04:44.250
This doesn't mean

79
00:04:44.250 --> 00:04:46.541
you distance yourself from worldly comforts

80
00:04:46.541 --> 00:04:49.541
or duties...

81
00:04:49.541 --> 00:04:51.791
Rather, it means

82
00:04:51.791 --> 00:04:54.708
you accept the truth

83
00:04:54.708 --> 00:04:57.708
that your supreme joy and peace

84
00:04:57.708 --> 00:05:01.208
don't come from material objects...

85
00:05:01.208 --> 00:05:03.583
but from the divine consciousness

86
00:05:03.583 --> 00:05:07.083
residing within you..!!

87
00:05:11.666 --> 00:05:15.875
Can material achievements and pleasures

88
00:05:15.875 --> 00:05:20.250
provide lasting peace and happiness?

89
00:05:20.250 --> 00:05:21.875
In the current situation,

90
00:05:21.875 --> 00:05:25.708
society has become completely
dependent on material objects,

91
00:05:25.708 --> 00:05:28.375
wealth, and prestige

92
00:05:28.375 --> 00:05:31.750
for its happiness and peace...

93
00:05:31.750 --> 00:05:35.333
But this happiness is only temporary...

94
00:05:35.333 --> 00:05:38.875
It won't stay with you forever...

95
00:05:38.875 --> 00:05:40.875
In fact,

96
00:05:40.875 --> 00:05:44.291
the craving for material pleasures
 gives birth to despair,

97
00:05:44.291 --> 00:05:51.708
exploitation, and differences and 
discrimination among people in society...

98
00:05:51.708 --> 00:05:54.416
Your craving for material pleasures

99
00:05:54.416 --> 00:05:57.208
gives birth to a culture...

100
00:05:57.208 --> 00:06:01.541
in which there's only competition
 and comparison...

101
00:06:01.541 --> 00:06:02.541
You make this comparison

102
00:06:02.541 --> 00:06:04.625
in your family and

103
00:06:04.625 --> 00:06:06.875
workplace too...

104
00:06:06.875 --> 00:06:09.333
You constantly think about

105
00:06:09.333 --> 00:06:14.458
why you don't have what others have...

106
00:06:14.458 --> 00:06:17.666
How others look... and how much

107
00:06:17.666 --> 00:06:20.250
praise they receive...!!

108
00:06:20.250 --> 00:06:21.916
But

109
00:06:21.916 --> 00:06:24.791
this very comparison and competition

110
00:06:24.791 --> 00:06:27.416
is the cause of emptiness

111
00:06:27.416 --> 00:06:30.291
and dissatisfaction within you...

112
00:06:30.291 --> 00:06:35.250
No matter how great material 
achievements may be...

113
00:06:35.250 --> 00:06:41.625
they will neither satisfy your
 mind... nor your soul...!!!

114
00:06:41.625 --> 00:06:43.583
The satisfaction of the soul lies

115
00:06:43.583 --> 00:06:47.541
in inner happiness and joy...!!

116
00:06:47.541 --> 00:06:49.041
The craving for material pleasures

117
00:06:49.041 --> 00:06:53.083
not only makes you dissatisfied...

118
00:06:53.083 --> 00:06:54.125
but also creates

119
00:06:54.125 --> 00:06:58.500
differences and discrimination in society...

120
00:06:58.500 --> 00:07:00.125
In your desire for more wealth

121
00:07:00.125 --> 00:07:03.083
and praise, you forget the welfare of others,

122
00:07:03.083 --> 00:07:04.083
society,

123
00:07:04.083 --> 00:07:07.541
and nature...

124
00:07:07.541 --> 00:07:09.208
This is the right time for you

125
00:07:09.208 --> 00:07:13.708
to free yourself from this cycle 
of material craving...

126
00:07:13.708 --> 00:07:16.500
and develop peace, compassion,

127
00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:20.625
and a relationship with the Divine within yourself...

128
00:07:20.625 --> 00:07:23.541
When you bring this change in yourself, 
you become familiar

129
00:07:23.541 --> 00:07:26.541
with the truth

130
00:07:26.541 --> 00:07:30.916
that comparing yourself with
others is pointless...

131
00:07:30.916 --> 00:07:34.708
It only brings discontent and sorrow...

132
00:07:34.708 --> 00:07:36.041
This acceptance

133
00:07:36.041 --> 00:07:38.625
and realization provide peace and 
contentment at both personal

134
00:07:38.625 --> 00:07:43.541
and social levels...

135
00:07:43.541 --> 00:07:44.541
You abandon attachment

136
00:07:44.541 --> 00:07:47.666
to material pleasures and
 maintain feelings of surrender

137
00:07:47.666 --> 00:07:50.291
and love toward the Divine

138
00:07:50.291 --> 00:07:54.208
and each other... And this is

139
00:07:54.208 --> 00:07:57.708
your path to lasting peace and happiness...

140
00:08:02.333 --> 00:08:05.625
Do you know...

141
00:08:05.625 --> 00:08:09.333
The happiness and peace you're seeking

142
00:08:09.333 --> 00:08:12.041
in your success, promotion,

143
00:08:12.041 --> 00:08:15.041
or rewards

144
00:08:15.041 --> 00:08:16.666
is actually

145
00:08:16.666 --> 00:08:18.916
the cause of your restlessness

146
00:08:18.916 --> 00:08:21.916
and discontent...

147
00:08:21.916 --> 00:08:24.250
In your professional life, you chase after

148
00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:26.583
material pleasures...

149
00:08:26.583 --> 00:08:31.375
like fame, praise, or wealth...

150
00:08:31.375 --> 00:08:34.583
Perhaps you feel this is

151
00:08:34.583 --> 00:08:39.291
your path to happiness and peace... But

152
00:08:39.291 --> 00:08:48.708
are you aware that this path traps
you in an endless cycle?

153
00:08:48.708 --> 00:08:52.458
It becomes your life's primary purpose...

154
00:08:52.458 --> 00:08:57.833
And this is also the cause of your stress and worry...

155
00:08:57.833 --> 00:09:01.333
The teaching of Karma Yoga teaches you

156
00:09:01.333 --> 00:09:05.041
that your satisfaction lies in doing the work,

157
00:09:05.041 --> 00:09:07.916
not in its results...

158
00:09:07.916 --> 00:09:11.958
Let's understand with an example...

159
00:09:11.958 --> 00:09:13.750
A craftsman who creates

160
00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:17.500
a sculpture with his hands

161
00:09:17.500 --> 00:09:18.875
experiences supreme joy

162
00:09:18.875 --> 00:09:21.416
in his work... 

163
00:09:21.416 --> 00:09:25.041
not in any reward or praise...

164
00:09:25.041 --> 00:09:26.458
Similarly,

165
00:09:26.458 --> 00:09:31.166
when you do your work with
 complete dedication,

166
00:09:31.166 --> 00:09:34.541
then you aren't troubled by
 concern for the results...

167
00:09:34.541 --> 00:09:37.875
Whatever they may be... Your mind

168
00:09:37.875 --> 00:09:42.458
experiences true peace and joy...

169
00:09:42.458 --> 00:09:44.750
When you focus more on your efforts

170
00:09:44.750 --> 00:09:46.041
than the results,

171
00:09:46.041 --> 00:09:49.041
you not only

172
00:09:49.041 --> 00:09:52.541
achieve excellence in your work...

173
00:09:52.541 --> 00:09:56.625
but also attain inner peace...

174
00:09:56.625 --> 00:10:00.208
Do your work with complete
 dedication and selfless spirit, 

175
00:10:00.208 --> 00:10:05.750
without worrying about personal gain...

176
00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:09.666
Without concern for the results... You'll see,

177
00:10:09.666 --> 00:10:12.583
success in work will certainly come...

178
00:10:12.583 --> 00:10:15.750
When you work free from worry about results...

179
00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:19.708
then this mental freedom not only

180
00:10:19.708 --> 00:10:22.875
opens the door to excellence

181
00:10:22.875 --> 00:10:27.125
but also fills every effort with unique energy

182
00:10:27.125 --> 00:10:30.250
and confidence...

183
00:10:30.250 --> 00:10:33.083
This is the power of Karma Yoga...!!
